<h1 data-copy-en="Honey" data-copy-zh="Honey">Honey</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Recruit Honey, plan the farm and even-night barn visits, and unlock her crafted gifts and shared activities." data-copy-zh="招募Honey，安排农场与双数日晚间谷仓拜访，查找手工礼物及共同活动。">Recruit Honey, plan the farm and even-night barn visits, and unlock her crafted gifts and shared activities.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One-Time_Resort_Group_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Honey"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sirena_Isle_Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Cucker-Chucker"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Family_and_Brothel_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Farm_Picnic_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="New_Opportunities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Recruitment_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Honey — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/honey.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Honey — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/honey.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Honey — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Honey’s route combines farm work, a picnic, two barn conversations, recruitment and worker activities. Her farm portrait, employed-worker visit menu and resort schedule are separate systems.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Where_to_Find_Honey"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Normal farm portrait:Rural Farm13:00–17:00 daily. The barn portrait needs Close Friend 200 and even days 21:00–24:00; both personal heart-to-hearts are barn-only.</p><p>Once active as staff, her Garden portrait is 20:00–21:00 daily and 21:00–24:00 on odd days. Vacation can move her to the resort.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Raise Close Friend 200 before planning Farm Troubles at the barn, even 21:00–24:00. Then Crush 400, Rose &amp; Thorn ownership and that completed conversation allow New Opportunities in the same barn window, subject to its content lock.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Father Daughter Bond</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Rural Farm; 09:00–14:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); Wilfred Acknowledged (10); home from vacation: Honey</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Moving Forward</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Rural Farm; 09:00–14:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); Wilfred Known (25); after Father Daughter Bond; home from vacation: Honey</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A New Path</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Rural Farm; 09:00–14:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); Wilfred Acquaintance (50); started New Opportunities; home from vacation: Honey</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Honey's Mother's Garden</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Garden; 20:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">home from vacation: Honey; the relevant employee active as staff</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Breaking in the Stallion</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Master Bedroom; 21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">affection 550; home from vacation: Honey; the relevant employee active as staff</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Farm Troubles</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Barn Interior; Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 10 Energy; restores 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">New Opportunities</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Barn Interior; Crush (400); after Farm Troubles; own Rose &amp; Thorn; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 15 Energy; 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>After starting the opportunities conversation, reach Wilfred Acquaintance 50 and visit the farm 09:00–15:00 for A New Path. This is an automatic event with its own hours, independent of the 13:00 portrait start. It activates Honey as staff.</p><p>The picnic is separate:Friend 100, farm 13:00–16:00,120 min/$30/30 Energy, once. At 550 affection, active and home, Breaking in the Stallion triggers in the Master Bedroom 21:00–24:00.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Gifts_and_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Skill_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Farm_and_Garden_Interactions"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Honey</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Rural Farm / Garden; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Help with Farm Work</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Rural Farm; Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">45 min; 25 Energy; 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+6 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Perfume to Honey</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Rural Farm; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Perfume</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+15 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Farm Picnic</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Rural Farm; Friend (100); 13:00–15:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $30; 30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Farm Wisdom</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Rural Farm; Known (25); Communication 44</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+10 direct affection; Stamina +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Honey</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Barn Interior; Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">25 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Crafted-gift scene</th><th scope="col">Where / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Cost</th><th scope="col">Training upgraded</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">All My Colors</th><td data-label="Where / start window">Rural Farm</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); home from vacation; Farm Picnic with Honey</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; hand in 1 Prismatic Spell Brooch</td><td data-label="Training upgraded">Cowgirl</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Open Gate</th><td data-label="Where / start window">Garden</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); home from vacation; Honey's Mother's Garden</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; hand in 1 Void-Kissed Charm</td><td data-label="Training upgraded">Missionary</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Plain Words</th><td data-label="Where / start window">Barn Interior</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); home from vacation; Breaking in the Stallion</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; hand in 1 Golden Pulse Bracelet</td><td data-label="Training upgraded">Oral</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Farm work gives 6 base affection,45 min/25 Energy/10 Calm, five/day from Acknowledged 10. Farm Perfume gives 15 base once/day from Known 25, consuming one Perfume. These differ from worker-menu gift rewards.</p><p>At In Love 3000, the three crafted gifts below upgrade training once each, consuming one gift for 0 min. Each adds 50% to her income multiplier and doubles that training’s experience. Their specific picnic/garden/bedroom prerequisites still apply.</p><p>After The Cuckers Return, the farm’s Cucker-Chucker activity runs 08:00–19:00,30 min/20 Energy; normal completion gives 3 base affection each to Honey and Wilfred. Staff visits/training, clothing and shared resort encounters use the Brothel/Resort guides; sunset walk is beach 17:00–20:00,60 min, once/day.</p><p>In Kupie's Love Training, Honey’s entry needs ordinary Friend 100 and Elara’s minigame level 5. Its affection, Hearts, Charms and gifts are separate from the main relationship.</p><p>Favorite stats are Strength, Stamina, Ability. Learning Power Strike improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Farm_Troubles"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Farm Troubles lists Known 25, while the barn portrait itself needs Close Friend 200. Plan the first barn conversation after 200.</li><li>The farm recruitment event is 09:00–15:00, not the night-barn conversation; raise Wilfred to 50 too.</li><li>A worker visit uses her actual working shift and rest/vacation state, not the farm portrait hours.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="character-wilfred.html">Wilfred</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Worker visits and training</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">Crafted gifts</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort activities and paired scenes</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Kupie’s Love Training</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One-Time_Resort_Group_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Honey"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sirena_Isle_Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Cucker-Chucker"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Family_and_Brothel_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Farm_Picnic_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-New_Opportunities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Recruitment_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Honey 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/honey.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Honey 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/honey.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Honey 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Honey的路线结合农活、野餐、两次谷仓交心、招募和员工活动。农场头像、员工拜访菜单与度假行程是不同系统。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Where_to_Find_Honey"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>普通农场头像每天13:00–17:00位于乡村农场。谷仓头像要求亲密朋友200，双数日21:00–24:00出现，两次个人交心都从谷仓开始。</p><p>启用为员工后，她在花园的头像为每天20:00–21:00，以及单数日21:00–24:00；度假时会前往度假岛。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先达到亲密朋友200，在双数日21:00–24:00的谷仓进行农场麻烦。之后迷恋400、拥有玫瑰与荆棘、完成前次交心，即可在同一谷仓时段进行新机会，另须满足其内容权限。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">父女羁绊</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">乡村农场；09:00–14:59</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10好感）；Wilfred 已遇见（10好感）；已结束度假：Honey</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">向前走</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">乡村农场；09:00–14:59</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25好感）；Wilfred 已知（25好感）；完成：父女羁绊；已结束度假：Honey</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一条新路</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">乡村农场；09:00–14:59</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400好感）；Wilfred 相识（50好感）；已开始新机会；已结束度假：Honey</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Honey 母亲的花园</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">花园；20:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">已结束度假：Honey；相关员工已启用为员工</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">驯服骏马</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">主卧；21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">好感550；已结束度假：Honey；相关员工已启用为员工</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">农场麻烦</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">谷仓内部；亲密朋友（200好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；10精力；恢复5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">新机会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">谷仓内部；迷恋（400好感）；完成：农场麻烦；拥有玫瑰与荆棘；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；15精力；5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>开始机会交心后，将Wilfred提高到相识50，再于农场09:00–15:00触发一条新路。这是独立时段的自动事件，不要求等到13:00头像出现；完成后Honey启用为员工。</p><p>野餐是独立活动：朋友100、农场13:00–16:00，120分钟、$30、30精力，仅一次。550好感、在职且留在青楼时，可于主卧21:00–24:00触发驯服骏马。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Gifts_and_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Skill_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Farm_and_Garden_Interactions"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Honey 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">乡村农场 / 花园；陌生人（0好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">帮忙农活</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">乡村农场；已遇见（10好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">45分钟；25精力；10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+6；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送香水给Honey</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">乡村农场；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；香水×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+15；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">农场野餐</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">乡村农场；朋友（100好感）；13:00–15:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$30；30精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">农场智慧</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">乡村农场；已知（25好感）；沟通44</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">直接好感+10；耐力+1；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Honey 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">谷仓内部；朋友（100好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">25分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">手工礼物事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">消耗</th><th scope="col">升级训练</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">我的每一种色彩</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">乡村农场</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000好感）；已结束度假；与 Honey 一起农场野餐</td><td data-label="消耗">0分钟；交付棱彩法术胸针×1</td><td data-label="升级训练">女上位</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">敞开的栅门</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">花园</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000好感）；已结束度假；Honey 母亲的花园</td><td data-label="消耗">0分钟；交付虚吻护符×1</td><td data-label="升级训练">传教士位</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">直白的话</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">谷仓内部</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000好感）；已结束度假；驯服骏马</td><td data-label="消耗">0分钟；交付金脉手镯×1</td><td data-label="升级训练">口交</td></tr></tbody></table><p>农活要求已遇见10，45分钟、25精力、10镇定，增加6基础好感，每天五次。农场送香水要求已知25，消耗一件香水，增加15基础好感，每天一次；与员工菜单的送礼奖励不同。</p><p>恋爱中3000可用下表三件手工礼物升级训练，各一次，每项交付一件、0分钟；收入倍率每项增加50%，对应训练获得双倍经验。仍须满足各自的野餐、花园或主卧前置。</p><p>完成鸡妖归来后，打击鸡妖在08:00–19:00开放，30分钟、20精力，正常结束为Honey和Wilfred各增加3基础好感。员工拜访、训练、服装和共同度假事件见青楼／度假指南；日落散步在海滩17:00–20:00开始，60分钟，每天一次。</p><p>在Kupie 的爱之训练中，Honey要求普通关系朋友100及Elara的小游戏等级5；该系统的好感、爱心、魅力及礼物与主关系分开。</p><p>偏好的属性为力量、耐力、能力。学会强力打击可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Farm_Troubles"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>农场麻烦标注已知25，谷仓头像本身则需要亲密朋友200，因此请先达到200再安排首次谷仓交心。</li><li>招募自动事件在农场09:00–15:00，不是在夜间谷仓；Wilfred也要达到50好感。</li><li>员工拜访按实际工作班次、休息及度假状态开放，不能直接套用农场头像时间。</li></ul></section>
